          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last synced"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次同步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过 CloudKit 同步服务器配置、非 Emby/Plex 播放进度、收藏和文件夹书签。密码与 OAuth 凭据仍保存在本机 Keychain，不会进入 iCloud。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CloudKit syncs server setups, non-Emby/Plex playback progress, favorites, and folder bookmarks. Passwords and OAuth credentials stay in the on-device Keychain and are not stored in iCloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 CloudKit 同步服务器配置、非 Emby/Plex 播放进度、收藏和文件夹书签。密码与 OAuth 凭据仍保存在本机 Keychain，不会进入 iCloud。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过 CloudKit 同步服务器配置、播放进度、收藏和文件夹书签。密码与 OAuth 凭据保存在本机 Keychain。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CloudKit syncs server setups, playback progress, favorites, and folder bookmarks. Passwords and OAuth credentials stay in the on-device Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 CloudKit 同步服务器配置、播放进度、收藏和文件夹书签。密码与 OAuth 凭据保存在本机 Keychain。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前构建未启用 CloudKit。iCloud 同步仅在 Release 构建（需付费开发者账号）中可用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This build does not enable CloudKit. iCloud sync is available only in Release builds that use a paid developer account."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前构建未启用 CloudKit。iCloud 同步仅在 Release 构建（需付费开发者账号）中可用。"
          }
        }
      }
