    "硬件解码优先仅影响 KSPlayer 播放路径，并在下一次加载视频时生效；如果硬解初始化失败，播放器会自动尝试软解。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hardware decoding only applies to the KSPlayer path and takes effect the next time a video loads. If hardware decoding fails to start, the player falls back to software decoding."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "硬件解码优先仅影响 KSPlayer 播放路径，并在下一次加载视频时生效；如果硬解初始化失败，播放器会自动尝试软解。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
